<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Waters cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Waters cut to hold.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>CS First Boston said Wednesday it downgraded Waters Corp to hold from buy.  </p>
<p>-- Analyst not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell one to 33-1/8.</p>
</text>
